<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DeepSeek · 深度求索</title>
    <style>
        /* 全局重置 */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0b0e14;
            color: #eef4ff;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* ========== 3D 金属文字层 (固定在最上层) ========== */
        .metal-3d-layer {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 100;
            perspective: 900px;
            perspective-origin: 50% 50%;
            opacity: 0.92;
            animation: metalLayerFloat 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes metalLayerFloat {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-12px); }
        }

        .metal-3d-wrap {
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
            animation: metalRotate 22s linear infinite;
            will-change: transform;
        }

        @keyframes metalRotate {
            0% { transform: rotateY(0deg) rotateX(6deg); }
            50% { transform: rotateY(180deg) rotateX(-4deg); }
            100% { transform: rotateY(360deg) rotateX(6deg); }
        }

        .metal-text {
            position: relative;
            font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 10vw, 7rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
            display: inline-block;
            user-select: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
            /* 金属基础色：银白到浅蓝渐变 */
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, 
                #f5f9ff 0%, 
                #c8d8e8 18%, 
                #ffffff 32%, 
                #9bb0c9 48%, 
                #e8f0fc 62%, 
                #b0c4da 78%, 
                #f0f7ff 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            /* 金属边缘高光 */
            -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(200, 225, 255, 0.4);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 22px rgba(100, 180, 255, 0.5))
                    drop-shadow(0 0 50px rgba(80, 140, 255, 0.25));
        }

        /* 多层文本叠加制造3D厚度与金属反光 */
        .metal-text::before,
        .metal-text::after {
            content: 'DeepSeek';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: inherit;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            -webkit-text-stroke: 1px transparent;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .metal-text::before {
            transform: translateZ(-8px) translateX(-1px) translateY(-1px);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #7a8fa8 0%, #4a6078 50%, #8aa0b8 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            opacity: 0.75;
            filter: blur(0.4px);
        }

        .metal-text::after {
            transform: translateZ(-16px) translateX(-2px) translateY(-2px);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3a4a5a 0%, #2a3a4a 50%, #4a5a6a 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            opacity: 0.55;
            filter: blur(0.8px);
        }

        /* 金属光泽扫过动画 (叠加一层) */
        .metal-shine {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(115deg, 
                transparent 20%, 
                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55) 38%, 
                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95) 46%, 
                rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55) 54%, 
                transparent 72%);
            background-size: 250% 100%;
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            animation: shineSweep 4.5s ease-in-out infinite;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        @keyframes shineSweep {
            0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
            60% { background-position: -100% 0; }
            100% { background-position: -100% 0; }
        }

        /* 辅助文字 (小号) 也带3D感 */
        .metal-sub {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 12vh;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.5em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.45);
            font-weight: 400;
            transform: translateZ(20px);
            animation: subPulse 3s ease-in-out infinite;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        @keyframes subPulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; letter-spacing: 0.5em; }
            50% { opacity: 0.8; letter-spacing: 0.65em; }
        }

        /* 背景容器——由滚动驱动的动态渐变/色相 (通过 JS 更新) */
        .bg-container {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 40%, rgba(38, 139, 210, 0.15) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(147, 112, 219, 0.15) 0%, transparent 55%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 80%, rgba(0, 180, 216, 0.1) 0%, transparent 45%);
            background-color: #0b0e14;
            transition: background-color 0.1s linear;
            will-change: background-color;
        }

        /* 星点层 (纯CSS装饰) */
        .star-field {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .star {
            position: absolute;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            opacity: 0.3;
            animation: starPulse 4s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes starPulse {
            0% { opacity: 0.1; transform: scale(0.8); }
            100% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1.2); }
        }

        /* 所有滚动内容都在这个容器内，相对z-index */
        .scroll-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem 6rem;
        }

        /* 区块通用样式 */
        .section {
            width: min(900px, 100%);
            margin: 4rem 0;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px);
            transition: opacity 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.3, 1), transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.3, 1);
        }

        .section.visible {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* 玻璃卡片 */
        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(18, 22, 32, 0.65);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(150%);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(150%);
            border-radius: 48px;
            padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6),
                        0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) inset,
                        0 0 40px rgba(0, 180, 255, 0.08);
            transition: box-shadow 0.3s, background 0.3s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* 顶部装饰线 */
        .glow-line {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 10%;
            width: 80%;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #4aa8ff, #a57cff, #4aa8ff, transparent);
            background-size: 200% 100%;
            border-radius: 2px;
            animation: lineFlow 4s linear infinite;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        @keyframes lineFlow {
            0% { background-position: 0% 0; }
            100% { background-position: 200% 0; }
        }

        /* 标题区域 */
        .hero {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .svg-avatar {
            width: 140px;
            height: 140px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 24px rgba(80, 170, 255, 0.6));
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #b8d9ff 80%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
        }

        .subhead {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8ea6c9;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .description {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #cbd6e6;
            max-width: 680px;
            margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        /* 特性卡片网格 */
        .features {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 1.6rem 1rem 1.4rem;
            flex: 1 1 150px;
            min-width: 130px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
        }

        .feature-item:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-color: rgba(100, 180, 255, 0.2);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px -8px rgba(0, 160, 255, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
            color: #7db9ff;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(80, 170, 255, 0.4));
        }

        .feature-label {
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eef6ff, #b0c8e8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        /* 每个区块的小标题 */
        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #b0d0ff);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }

        .section-title svg {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            opacity: 0.9;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* 内容列表 */
        .info-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.8rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .info-item {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.2rem;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .info-icon {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            color: #88c0ff;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(80, 170, 255, 0.3));
        }

        .info-text h3 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #dceaff;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .info-text p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #a6b9d2;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        /* 技术标签 */
        .tech-tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            margin-top: 1.6rem;
        }

        .tech-tag {
            background: rgba(80, 170, 255, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(80, 170, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 40px;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #b8d9ff;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            transition: background 0.2s, border 0.2s;
        }

        .tech-tag:hover {
            background: rgba(80, 170, 255, 0.15);
            border-color: rgba(80, 170, 255, 0.4);
        }

        /* 签名 */
        .signature {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #7d8fa8;
            letter-spacing: 0.03em;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .signature svg {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        /* 首屏内容区需要额外下边距，为3D文字留出视觉空间 */
        .scroll-content {
            padding-top: 18vh;
        }

        /* 响应式 */
        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
            .glass-card { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 32px; }
            .section-title { font-size: 1.6rem; }
            .info-item { gap: 0.8rem; }
            .info-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
            .svg-avatar { width: 110px; height: 110px; }
            .subhead { font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
            .description { font-size: 1rem; }
            .metal-text { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 12vw, 4.5rem); }
            .metal-sub { font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
            .feature-item { min-width: 100px; padding: 1.2rem 0.6rem; }
            .feature-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
            .tech-tag { padding: 0.35rem 1rem; font-size: 0.8rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- ===== 3D 金属文字层 (最上层) ===== -->
    <div class="metal-3d-layer">
        <div class="metal-3d-wrap">
            <div class="metal-text">
                DeepSeek
                <div class="metal-shine"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="metal-sub">深度求索 · 智能之境</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 动态背景 (色相由滚动位置控制) -->
    <div class="bg-container" id="bgContainer"></div>

    <!-- 星点层 -->
    <div class="star-field" id="starField"></div>

    <!-- 所有滚动内容 -->
    <div class="scroll-content">

        <!-- 首屏：品牌核心 -->
        <div class="section hero visible" id="heroSection">
            <div class="glass-card" style="width: 100%;">
                <div class="glow-line"></div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center;">
                    <!-- 主视觉 SVG -->
                    <svg class="svg-avatar" viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <defs>
                            <linearGradient id="ringGrad" x1="20%" y1="20%" x2="80%" y2="80%">
                                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#4aa8ff" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
                                <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#a57cff" stop-opacity="0.8"/>
                                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4aa8ff" stop-opacity="0.6"/>
                            </linearGradient>
                            <linearGradient id="innerGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#8cc6ff" />
                                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#c9a2ff" />
                            </linearGradient>
                            <filter id="glow" x="-30%" y="-30%" width="160%" height="160%">
                                <feGaussianBlur in="SourceGraphic" stdDeviation="3" result="blur" />
                                <feMerge>
                                    <feMergeNode in="blur" />
                                    <feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic" />
                                </feMerge>
                            </filter>
                        </defs>
                        <!-- 外环旋转 -->
                        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="46" stroke="url(#ringGrad)" stroke-width="2.2" fill="none"
                                stroke-dasharray="6 12" opacity="0.8">
                            <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 60 60" to="360 60 60" dur="12s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
                        </circle>
                        <!-- 第二层环反向 -->
                        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="34" stroke="url(#ringGrad)" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none"
                                stroke-dasharray="4 10" opacity="0.6">
                            <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="360 60 60" to="0 60 60" dur="18s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
                        </circle>
                        <!-- 核心 -->
                        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="20" fill="url(#innerGrad)" opacity="0.2" filter="url(#glow)" />
                        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="12" fill="url(#innerGrad)" opacity="0.9">
                            <animate attributeName="r" values="12;13.5;12;12" dur="3s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
                        </circle>
                        <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="4.5" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.9" />
                        <path d="M60 34 L60 42 M60 78 L60 86 M34 60 L42 60 M78 60 L86 60"
                              stroke="#b8d9ff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.6" />
                    </svg>

                    <h1>DeepSeek</h1>
                    <div class="subhead">深度求索 · 智能之境</div>
                    <p class="description">
                        由深度求索公司创造的 AI 助手。以纯粹的逻辑与广博的知识为基石，
                        在对话中理解，在思考中创造，为每一个问题寻找深刻的答案。
                    </p>

                    <!-- 特性卡片 -->
                    <div class="features">
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                <circle cx="20" cy="16" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
                                <circle cx="12" cy="28" r="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
                                <circle cx="28" cy="28" r="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
                                <path d="M15 20 L12 23 M25 20 L28 23 M20 22 L20 26 M17 26 L12 28 M23 26 L28 28"
                                      stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.8" />
                            </svg>
                            <span class="feature-label">深度思考</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                <path d="M8 20 C8 14, 14 12, 18 16 L22 20 C26 24, 32 22, 32 16 C32 12, 28 10, 24 12 L20 16 C16 20, 10 18, 8 20Z"
                                      stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none" />
                                <path d="M32 20 C32 26, 26 28, 22 24 L18 20 C14 16, 8 18, 8 24 C8 28, 12 30, 16 28 L20 24 C24 20, 30 22, 32 20Z"
                                      stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none" />
                            </svg>
                            <span class="feature-label">长上下文</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="feature-item">
                            <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                <rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
                                <rect x="20" y="20" width="12" height="12" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" />
                                <path d="M14 20 L14 28 L20 28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" />
                                <path d="M26 14 L26 20 L20 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" />
                            </svg>
                            <span class="feature-label">多模态理解</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 第二个区块：关于深度求索 -->
        <div class="section" id="aboutSection">
            <div class="glass-card">
                <div class="section-title">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <circle cx="15" cy="15" r="11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
                        <path d="M15 8 L15 22 M8 15 L22 15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
                    </svg>
                    关于我们
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.9; color: #c3d3e8; margin-bottom: 1.8rem;">
                    深度求索（DeepSeek）是一家专注于人工智能技术研发的公司，致力于探索智能的边界。
                    我们相信，通过持续的技术创新和对本质的深入思考，能够构建真正理解人类意图的 AI 系统。
                </p>
                <div class="info-list">
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M20 6 L24 16 L35 16 L26 23 L30 34 L20 27 L10 34 L14 23 L5 16 L16 16 L20 6Z" 
                                  stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.08" />
                        </svg>
                        <div class="info-text">
                            <h3>纯粹的技术驱动</h3>
                            <p>不追逐浮华，专注于底层模型能力的提升，让智能本身成为最好的表达。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" />
                            <path d="M20 12 L20 20 L26 26" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        </svg>
                        <div class="info-text">
                            <h3>长远的探索视角</h3>
                            <p>不满足于短期成效，持续投入基础研究，在深度与广度上同时推进。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 第三个区块：核心能力 -->
        <div class="section" id="capabilitiesSection">
            <div class="glass-card">
                <div class="section-title">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M7 20 L7 10 L13 10 L13 20 M17 20 L17 6 L23 6 L23 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        <circle cx="7" cy="24" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
                        <circle cx="17" cy="24" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
                        <circle cx="23" cy="24" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
                    </svg>
                    核心能力
                </div>
                <div class="info-list">
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <rect x="8" y="10" width="24" height="18" rx="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" />
                            <path d="M14 18 L18 22 L26 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                        </svg>
                        <div class="info-text">
                            <h3>复杂推理与问题求解</h3>
                            <p>面对多步骤、跨领域的复杂问题，能够拆解逻辑链条，提供清晰严谨的解答。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-item">
                        <svg class="info-icon" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                            <path d="M20 8 C14 8 10 12 10 18 C10 24 14 28 20 28 C26 28 30 24 30 18 C30 12 26 8 20 8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" />
                            <circle cx="20" cy="18" r="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" />
                        </svg>
                        <div class="info-text">
                            <h3>深层语义理解</h3>
                            <p>超越字面含义，捕捉对话中的隐含意图与情感脉络，给出有温度的回应。</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="tech-tags">
                    <span class="tech-tag">Transformer</span>
                    <span class="tech-tag">长上下文窗口</span>
                    <span class="tech-tag">多轮对话</span>
                    <span class="tech-tag">代码生成</span>
                    <span class="tech-tag">数学推理</span>
                    <span class="tech-tag">知识问答</span>
