        </div>

        <!-- 第四个区块：愿景 -->
        <div class="section" id="visionSection">
            <div class="glass-card" style="text-align: center;">
                <div class="section-title" style="justify-content: center;">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M15 4 L17 12 L25 12 L19 17 L21 25 L15 20 L9 25 L11 17 L5 12 L13 12 L15 4Z" 
                              stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.1" />
                    </svg>
                    愿景
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.9; color: #d0e0f5; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;">
                    “让智能回归本质，以深度求索连接每一个未知。”
                </p>
                <div class="signature" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M12 2L15 9H22L16 14L18 21L12 17L6 21L8 14L2 9H9L12 2Z"
                              stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.1" />
